.Controller Names


[Roland RD-100 Controllers]
6=6-Data Entry MSB
7=7-Volume
11=11-Expression
38=38-Data Entry LSB
64=64-Hold 1 (sustain)
67=67-Soft Pedal
91=91-Reverb Depth
93=93-Chorus Depth
100=100-RPN LSB
101=101-RPN MSB
121=121-Reset Controllers

